  "summary": "The overall structure is functional but overly dense. The main risks are dereferencing an apparently optional grade, using inconsistent keys for findings and input traces, implicit submit buttons, and incomplete ARIA tab behavior. Test coverage is unknown because no coverage evidence was supplied, and ESLint evidence was unavailable because dependencies were missing.",
