      "title": "Input trace lookup discards the input scope",
      "description": "Inputs are tracked using the composite \u0060scope:id\u0060 identity, indicating that the same ID can occur in multiple scopes, but finding counts are retrieved using only \u0060input.id\u0060. Duplicate IDs across scopes can therefore show the wrong trace count.",
